21:12:45.778 SET-FIELD PROBE IS ON - which by now means 'the channel answers at all'. The
21:12:45.778   flag is a misnomer kept for the launch line: without it Session::handle
21:12:45.779   returns nothing for every packet, so the migration hello goes unanswered and
21:12:45.779   the client freezes on 'Connecting...'.
21:12:45.779   With it on, this channel answers: the migration hello with a SetField
21:12:45.780   carrying the character's real record (presence[0] the stat block, presence[2]
21:12:45.780   the equipped list), 0x00DC with that field's NPCs and mobs, 0x00D1 with the
21:12:45.780   portal's destination, 0x00E7 with the !map GM command, and 0x0151 with a
21:12:45.780   script Say. Equipment, mobs and the Say are BUILT BUT UNCONFIRMED on screen.
